WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:06.000
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and since there
have been a bunch of new comic book characters

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.250
joining the Flash and Arrow I wanted to do
a video series for some of the bigger ones.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.660
Today is going to be all about Captain Cold.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:12.660
Why is he a big deal?

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.660
Because he’s one of the most famous Flash
villains from the comics and he’s being

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.640
played by Wentworth Miller from Prison Break.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:19.609
I can already hear the Iron Heights Prison
break memes.

00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:22.892
So I’ll start with his origin story and
then talk about how they might use him on

00:00:22.892 --> 00:00:23.892
the show.

00:00:23.892 --> 00:00:27.000
If you’re just finding me for the first
time I do Arrow and Flash videos every week.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.320
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:34.560
Real Quick too, if you’ve seen the first
episode, please use spoiler tags in the comments.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.680
Most people still haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:40.540
Captain Cold’s real name is Leonard Snart,
when the tv show introduces him, that’s

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.660
who he’ll be.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.930
Over time he’ll get his superpowers and
become Captain Cold.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:44.930
Probably in that first hour.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:48.350
They did something similar with Weather Wizard
so they’re not waiting forever to show superpowers.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:49.790
I know you guys are really happy about that.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.830
Less waiting means more smashing time.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:55.790
They’ve changed his backstory a couple times
in the comics but here’s his original origin

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:56.790
story.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:00.940
His first appearance was in 1957 and he was
created by Carmine Infantino, the same person

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:01.940
who created The Flash.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:05.780
So no surprise that he created one of the
Flash’s best villains.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:11.200
Originally Captain Cold used a stolen Cold
Gun to pull heists.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.179
Usually to get hot women to like him.

00:01:13.179 --> 00:01:14.740
Remember this was a long time ago.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:21.240
At one point he learned about a big score,
escaped from prison and teamed up with his

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.899
Sister Golden Glider the Trickster and Heatwave
to steal the money.

00:01:24.899 --> 00:01:30.049
But they were thwarted by Barry Allen who
teamed up with Jay Garrick.

00:01:30.049 --> 00:01:31.539
That was the beginnings of the Rogues.

00:01:31.539 --> 00:01:35.710
A group of Flash villains that banded together.

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:40.049
They’re like the Bad News Bears of villain
teams.

00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:42.110
Think of the Crime Syndicate as the Yankees.

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:44.009
World Series Champs of Evil.

00:01:44.009 --> 00:01:47.009
The Rogues are usually the guys that get their
asses handed to them every week.

00:01:47.009 --> 00:01:51.590
So most of the time they were used for comedy.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:57.609
Later stories made his sister a much bigger
part of his backstory.

00:01:57.609 --> 00:02:01.969
Like he was a criminal because he needed money
to take care of his sister.

00:02:01.969 --> 00:02:03.299
Just to make the character more sympathetic.

00:02:03.299 --> 00:02:07.310
He’s not a villain because he’s evil,
he’s a villain of circumstance.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.549
Which is probably how the tv show is going
to treat him.

00:02:11.549 --> 00:02:14.970
He did try to reform for a while and formed
a company called Golden Snowball Recoveries

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:20.670
with his sister Golden Glider, but then later
he ended up killing one of his former prison

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.730
inmates named Brad Brickley.

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:27.280
The case became an unsolved mystery that the
Central City police department used to test

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.280
new cadets.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.239
Eventually Bart Allen solved it.

00:02:30.239 --> 00:02:33.190
The tv show isn’t doing Bart Allen, at least
right now.

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:37.440
And the big unsolved mystery at the moment
is Barry’s Mother’s murder.

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:41.459
Before Geoff Johns and DC Comics did their
whole New 52 reboot Captain Cold and the Rogues

00:02:41.459 --> 00:02:43.560
even killed Bart Allen and then later killed
Inertia for double crossing them.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:48.730
During the big Flashpoint storyline he wound
up living as a person named Citizen Cold masquerading

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:51.700
as a hero of the city trying to hide his past
crimes.

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:57.780
He even has this weird relationship with Iris
West.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:03.600
The other Rogues kidnap his sister and he
ends up murdering them all but not before

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.670
they kill her.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:13.560
Iris West finds out about all the horrible
stuff he did and gets him with one of his

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:14.560
own cold weapons.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.650
After the new 52 Reboot all of the Rogues
including Captain Cold were given real life

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:22.030
superpowers as part of a freak accident with
Star Labs Tech.

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:25.160
So now he doesn’t need his cold guns anymore
to freeze stuff.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:30.340
And in case you never read any old Flash comics
or the new ones.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:35.129
When DC did the big new 52 reboot they wiped
all of the old stuff from continuity.

00:03:35.129 --> 00:03:39.519
So when you meet the new fully superpowered
Captain Cold, he’s a brand new character.

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:42.209
The show is probably going to do that version
of him.

00:03:42.209 --> 00:03:45.109
But Geoff Johns and the other writers are
really good about including easter eggs from

00:03:45.109 --> 00:03:46.440
the classic comics.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:51.739
If you want to read some “Cool” Captain
Cold Stories you should check out Geoff Johns

00:03:51.739 --> 00:03:55.930
Flash Omnibus, there are three different volumes
all of them are awesome.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:59.310
He goes to comic book conventions all the
time, so if you find him at one there’s

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:01.260
a pretty good chance he’ll sign it for you.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.340
He’s really nice to his fans.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:06.840
On the show Wentworth Miller is going to debut
as Leonard Snart in Episode 4.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:11.019
That’s also the same episode Felicity is
guest starring in from Arrow.

00:04:11.019 --> 00:04:12.060
The episode is named Oracle.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:15.180
So as much as it’s going to be a Captain
Cold episode, I think the real focus will

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.959
be Felicity.

00:04:16.959 --> 00:04:20.169
I know comic book fans will go a little nuts
at that title too.

00:04:20.169 --> 00:04:23.889
Oracle is the name Barbara Gordon takes when
she forms the Birds of Prey group.

00:04:23.889 --> 00:04:27.310
Arrow did a birds of prey episode last year
and they’re going to do it again this year.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:32.840
Yes, Felicity will be the Oracle of the team
with Huntress and Black Canary.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:39.214
She’s back for 3 episodes, so if they do
a birds of prey episode after Caity Lotz is

00:04:39.214 --> 00:04:42.810
gone, they might substitute Katana for her
in the group.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:46.521
The Captain Cold episode isn’t going to
be a Birds of Prey story or anything, but

00:04:46.521 --> 00:04:49.240
it will explain everything about how the show
is going to treat the character.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:53.389
But because the Particle Accelerator explosion
created a ton of new metahumans.

00:04:53.389 --> 00:04:58.650
It’s likely that Wenworth Miller will be
a normal person in a bad situation who figures

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.250
superpowers are the answer to all his problems.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:04.840
I’m hoping he’s forced to commit some
crime to save his sister and then “shazam”,

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:09.819
he gets powers and has a really bad run in
with the Flash.

00:05:09.819 --> 00:05:15.120
There has to be a reason for Captain Cold
to hate the Flash, a reason for him to form

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.230
the Rogues.

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:21.930
On the show, nobody knows the Fash exits,
so they’ll have to have that first run in

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:25.449
and Barry will have to do something to make
Wentworth Miller hate him.

00:05:25.449 --> 00:05:27.520
Think of it as the Batman problem.

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:31.210
Batman is a force of nature in Gotham, he
is a force for justice, but because he’s

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:36.009
so agressive he causes a lot of collateral
damage and forces criminals to up their game.

00:05:36.009 --> 00:05:39.290
Thus super-weirdos start crawling out of the
woodwork.

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:42.120
So he creates almost as many villains as he
puts away in Arkham.

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:44.910
And the same will be true for Barry Allen.

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.060
For every rogue that he puts away in Iron
Heights.

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.259
Two more rise up.

00:05:48.259 --> 00:05:49.580
Oh wait wrong show, that’s Hydra.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:50.990
You get the idea.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:54.950
And just to clarify, Iron Heights Prison is
like The Flash’s version of Arkham.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:58.350
And think about this.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:04.370
The Flash is doing a freak of the week model
for the first half of the season.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.300
So he’ll be arresting several supervillains.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:10.699
Eventually they’ll all probably try to form
a prison break, which takes us back to Wentworth

00:06:10.699 --> 00:06:11.699
Miller.

00:06:11.699 --> 00:06:15.050
It’s also possible that Captain Cold could
start out in Prison when we first see him.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:19.599
And the explosion gives him powers which he
then uses to break out of prison.

00:06:19.599 --> 00:06:21.919
Wentworth Miller has a really specific face
though.

00:06:21.919 --> 00:06:25.250
I feel like they cast him because they wanted
a sympathetic villain.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.530
Which points back to Captain Cold’s sister.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.419
Either way it’s going to be awesome.

00:06:29.419 --> 00:06:33.090
Because the Flash is starting Tuesday October
7th, that means that the Captain Cold episode,

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:34.629
which is also the Felicity crossover, will
air October 28th.

00:06:34.629 --> 00:06:35.629
Right around Halloween.

00:06:35.629 --> 00:06:41.830
Because Captain Cold is such a big character
in the comics and Wentworth Miller is such

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:48.570
a big actor it sounds like the show is going
to use him as a brother blood level villain

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:49.570
this season.

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:50.570
Like the Darth Vader level villain.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:54.110
There’s always the emperor waiting in the
distance, which on the Flash is the Reverse

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:55.379
Flash.

00:06:55.379 --> 00:07:00.039
But before he reveals himself we get a whole
lotta Rogues.

